<title>UK: Bilton Plc '96 pretax profit inches up.</title>
<headline>Bilton Plc '96 pretax profit inches up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  14.62		vs   14.31</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   10.59		vs   10.33</p>
<p> Net asset value per shr 312.00		vs  315.00</p>
<p> Pretax			 18.5		 vs   18.2</p>
<p> Turnover (Trade)	   10.2		 vs   10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Bilton's property as valued on December 31, 1996 stood at 304.1 million stg against 306.0 million stg in the previous year.</p>
<p>Full company name - Bilton Plc</p>
